                    <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
                    <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">(*) Each 10 warrants are exercisable into one IPO unit consisting of one share and one IPO warrant with an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20220808124822542" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240630" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">88.00</ix:nonFraction> (Note 5d).</span></span></div>
                    <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">(**) On April 15, 2024, the Company amended the terms of certain existing warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20220811133754729" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxDecember2023WarrantsMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">935,792</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares that were previously issued in December 2023 (the &#8220;December 2023 Warrants&#8221;). Pursuant to the terms of the amendment, the exercise price of the December 2023 Warrants was reduced from $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813125650864" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_srtRangeAxis_srtMaximumMember_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxDecember2023WarrantsMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.85</ix:nonFraction> per share to $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813110838057" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_srtRangeAxis_srtMinimumMember_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxDecember2023WarrantsMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per share, and the expiration date was amended from December 28, 2028 to April 15, 2029, due to the change of the exercise price of the <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813125937313" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxDecember2023WarrantsMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">935,792</ix:nonFraction> warrants, the fair value of the warrants was increased by <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142010470" name="prfx:IncreaseInFairValueOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_srtRangeAxis_srtMaximumMember_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxDecember2023WarrantsMember" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">177</ix:nonFraction> which the company recorded and offset in the same amount, in the additional paid in capital, the company used black and Scholes model with these estimations: expected terms of <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20230809045623050" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" contextRef="C_20230101to20230608" format="ixt-sec:duryear">4.75</ix:nonNumeric> years, interest risk free of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230809045944478" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="C_20230101to20230608" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4.68</ix:nonFraction>%, yearly volatility of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230809050000029" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="C_20230101to20230608" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">97.24</ix:nonFraction>%.</span></span></div>
                    <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">(***) In April 15, 2024 the company issued to investors <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813133548724" name="prfx:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants with an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813133957594" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.80</ix:nonFraction> and additional <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813133926105" name="prfx:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">350,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants with exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813134117808" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.00</ix:nonFraction> to the underwriters. (Note 5d)</span></span></div>
                  </div>
                </ix:nonNumeric>
                <p style="margin:0pt">&#160;</p>
                <div>
                  <div>
                    <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25">
                      <div><ix:exclude>
                        <div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:8pt;margin-bottom:3pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">F - 8</span></span></p><div style="page-break-after:always"><hr style="border-width:0px;clear:both;margin:4px 0px;width:100%;height:2px;color:#000000;background-color:#000000"/></div><p style="margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align:right"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, Serif;font-size:10pt"><strong>PAINREFORM LTD. </strong></span></p></div><div style="font:10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif;margin:0pt 0;text-align:right">&#160;</div><div style="font:10pt Times New Roman, Times, serif;margin:0pt 0px"><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><strong><span style="font-size:10pt">NOTES TO CONDENSED </span></strong></span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><strong><span style="font-size:10pt">UNAUDITED&#160;</span></strong></span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><strong><span style="font-size:10pt">FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></strong></span></p><div style="text-align:center;text-align:center"><hr style="height:1px;width:100%;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border:medium none;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:center"/></div><div style="margin-bottom:10pt"><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><strong><span style="font-size:10pt">U.S. dollars in thousands, except share and per share data</span></strong></span></p></div></div>
                        <p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><strong><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif">NOTE 5: SHAREHOLDERS&#8217; EQUITY (Cont.)</span></strong></p>
                        <p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
                      </ix:exclude></div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">On July 14, 2023, the Company sold to a certain institutional investor (&#8220;the investor&#8221;) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813134931669" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20230714_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">117,930</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140132582" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="C_20230714_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, and prefunded warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813134720901" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20230701to20230714_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">183,300</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813134746233" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20230714_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">8.999</ix:nonFraction>, resulting in gross proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813135357542" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20230701to20230714_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.7</ix:nonFraction> million. In addition, the Company issued to the investor unregistered warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813192729925" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20230701to20230714_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_usgaapPrivatePlacementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">301,230</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares in a concurrent private placement.</span></span></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">On July 18, 2023, the Company sold to the investor <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140517467" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20230718_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">145,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140525413" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="C_20230718_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, and prefunded warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140540453" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20230701to20230718_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">21,666</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140548497" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20230718_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">8.999</ix:nonFraction>, resulting in gross proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140556191" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20230701to20230718_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million. In addition, the Company issued to the investor unregistered warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813140629263" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20230701to20230718_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_usgaapPrivatePlacementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">166,666</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares in a concurrent private placement.</span></span></div>
              <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">On December 28, 2023, the Company entered into an inducement offer letter agreement, or the Inducement Letter, with the investor, of certain of the Company&#8217;s existing warrants to purchase up to (i) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142326008" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20230701to20230714_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">301,230</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares issued on July 14, 2023 at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142516944" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20230714_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9.00</ix:nonFraction> per ordinary share, or the July 14 Warrants, and (ii) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142547487" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20230718_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">166,666</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares issued on July 18, 2023 at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142558120" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="C_20230718_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9.00</ix:nonFraction> per ordinary share, or the July 18 Warrants and together with the July 14, Warrants, the Existing Warrants.</span></span></div>
              <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Pursuant to the Inducement Letter, the investor agreed to exercise for cash its Existing Warrants to purchase an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142706806" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20231201to20231228_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">467,896</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares at a reduced exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813142924353" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20231228_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.85</ix:nonFraction> per ordinary share, resulting in gross proceeds to the Company of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813143313059" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20231201to20231228_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.3</ix:nonFraction> million, and net proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813143316487" name="prfx:NetProceedsOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20231201to20231228_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1</ix:nonFraction> million. In addition, the Investor received <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813143336989" name="prfx:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" contextRef="C_20231201to20231228_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">935,792</ix:nonFraction> new warrants with an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813143340367" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20231228_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.85</ix:nonFraction>.</span></span></div>
              <div style="line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">As of December 31, 2023 the Company issued <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813144540707" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20231231_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">170,000</ix:nonFraction> shares out of the <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813144545025" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20231231_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">467,896</ix:nonFraction> shares that the investor paid for, leaving the investor with the right to receive an additional <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813144553729" name="us-gaap:SharesIssued" contextRef="C_20231231_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInducementOfferLetterAgreementMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">297,896</ix:nonFraction> shares. On March 12, 2024 the Company issued <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813145056331" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20240312_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">121,896</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares and On April 9, 2024, the Company issued the remaining <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813145100951" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20240409_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">176,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares. As of June 30, 2024 all the prefunded shares that were registered on December 31, 2023 were issued to the investor.</span></span></div>
              <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
