            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="line-height:1.25">
                <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;width:100%">

                    <tr style="vertical-align:top">
                      <td style="text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:27pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">c.</span></span></td>
                      <td style="text-align:justify;vertical-align:top;width:auto"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">On April 15, 2024, the Company sold to certain institutional investors an aggregate of (i) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813150415306" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxApril2024SharesMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">447,500</ix:nonFraction> of its ordinary shares (the &#8220;April 2024 Shares&#8221;), (ii) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813150441161" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxApril2024SharesMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4,552,500</ix:nonFraction> prefunded warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813150458393" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxApril2024SharesMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4,552,500</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares (the &#8220;Prefunded Warrants&#8221;), and (iii) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151308419" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInvestorWarrantsMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151317035" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInvestorWarrantsMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares (the &#8220;Investor Warrants&#8221;), at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151501475" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxApril2024SharesMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.80</ix:nonFraction> per April 2024 Share and accompanying Investor Warrant, and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151532729" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_prfxInvestorWarrantsMember_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.7999</ix:nonFraction> per Prefunded Warrant and accompanying Investor Warrant, and (iv) <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151613486" name="prfx:WarrantsIssuedToPurchaseAggregateOrdinaryShares" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">350,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants to purchase <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151631876" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">350,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151712643" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.00</ix:nonFraction> were issued to the underwriter resulting in gross proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151750490" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4.0</ix:nonFraction> million. The net proceeds from the transaction were $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151814147" name="prfx:NetProceedsOfWarrants" contextRef="C_20240401to20240415_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_prfxUnderwriterMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.3</ix:nonFraction> million. Up to June 30, 2024 the company issued to the investors <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151848906" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20240630_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">994,500</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares out of the prefunded warrants, leaving <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20240813151914252" name="prfx:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" contextRef="C_20240101to20240630_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_usgaapInvestorMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,558,000</ix:nonFraction> as a prefunded warrants. The Prefunded Warrants and the Investor Warrants and were classified as equity.</span></span></td>
                    </tr>

                </table>
